---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import SchemaBreadcrumb from '../../components/seo/SchemaBreadcrumb.astro';
import SchemaFAQ from '../../components/seo/SchemaFAQ.astro';
import SchemaSoftwareApp from '../../components/seo/SchemaSoftwareApp.astro';
import FaqAccordion from '../../components/content/FaqAccordion.astro';
import RelatedCalculators from '../../components/content/RelatedCalculators.astro';
import RelatedArcana from '../../components/content/RelatedArcana.astro';
import MatrixCalculator from '../../components/calculator/MatrixCalculator';
import { calculatorFaq } from '../../data/faq';
import { calculators } from '../../data/calculators';

const breadcrumbItems = [{ label: 'Matriz del Destino' }];

const relatedCalculators = calculators.filter((c) => c.slug !== 'matriz-del-destino');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free Matriz del Destino Calculator — Instant Reading | Arcania"
  description="Free Matriz del Destino calculator in English. Enter your date of birth and get your complete octagram, 22 arcana, karmic tail, life purpose, and lines instantly."
>
  <SchemaBreadcrumb slot="schema" items={breadcrumbItems} />
  <SchemaFAQ slot="schema" qa={calculatorFaq} />
  <SchemaSoftwareApp
    slot="schema"
    name="Matriz del Destino Calculator"
    description="Free Matriz del Destino calculator based on date of birth, with an interpretation of every position in the octagram."
  />

  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-5xl">
      Free Matriz del Destino Calculator
    </h1>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-lg text-ink-muted">
      <p>
        Calculate your complete Matriz del Destino from your date of birth: your octagram, your
        masculine and feminine lines, your karmic tail, your money line, and your personal, social,
        general, and planetary purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        The result is calculated instantly, directly in your browser, with no registration and no cost.
        Below the calculator you'll find a complete explanation of the method and how to interpret each
        position.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <MatrixCalculator client:visible />
  </div>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-3xl">What is the Matriz del Destino?</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-4 text-ink-muted">
      <p>
        The Matriz del Destino — also known as the soul matrix or soul map — is a self-knowledge system
        created in 2006 by Russian numerologist Natalia Ladini. It integrates numerology, the 22 major
        arcana of the tarot, the chakra tradition, and the geometry of an octagram (an eight-pointed star
        formed by two overlapping squares) to build a symbolic diagnosis of your personality and life
        path.
      </p>
      <p>
        The first square — the central square — describes your personality, your talents, the
        generational energy you inherit, and your earthly mission. The second — the ancestral or
        diagonal square — adds a layer of energies inherited from your family lineage. From the
        intersection of both emerge your point E (your comfort zone), your karmic tail, your masculine
        and feminine lines, your money line, and your personal, social, general, and planetary purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        Unlike a tarot spread, the arcana here aren't drawn at random — they're derived mathematically
        from your date of birth, so your matrix is always the same and you can come back to check it
        whenever you like.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-3xl">How is it calculated?</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-4 text-ink-muted">
      <p>Our calculator does all of this automatically, but here's how the method works step by step:</p>
      <ol class="flex list-decimal flex-col gap-3 pl-5">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-ink">Point A (day):</strong> your day of birth is taken and, if it exceeds
          22, its digits are reduced until reaching a number between 1 and 22 — each value corresponds to
          one of the 22 major arcana.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-ink">Point B (month):</strong> your month of birth is used directly
          (1 to 12).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-ink">Point C (year):</strong> all the digits of your year of birth are
          added together and the result is reduced the same way.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-ink">Point D (mission):</strong> the reduced sum of A + B + C.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-ink">Point E (comfort zone):</strong> the reduced sum of A + B + C + D,
          your central arcana.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-ink">Ancestral square and lines:</strong> from these five values, the rest
          of the positions are derived — the masculine and feminine lines, the karmic tail, the money
          line, the chakras, and the four purposes.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        If you're interested in the full detail of every formula, we explain it with complete
        transparency on our <a href="/metodo/" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">method</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-3xl">How to interpret your result</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-4 text-ink-muted">
      <p>
        Each position in your matrix is interpreted by combining two layers: what that position
        represents (for example, "your money line") and the meaning of the arcana that landed there.
        That's why two people with the same central arcana can experience it differently depending on
        which other positions it appears in.
      </p>
      <p>
        Below the interactive octagram you'll find the position-by-position breakdown, and further down,
        tabs organised by theme — purpose, relationships, career, and strengths and challenges — so you
        can read your result according to what you want to explore first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FaqAccordion heading="Frequently Asked Questions" qa={calculatorFaq} />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6">
    <p class="rounded-xl bg-surface-alt px-5 py-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">
      This calculator is a self-knowledge tool and should not be interpreted as a form of divination or
      fortune-telling. We invite you to use it as a starting point for personal reflection, not as a
      definitive diagnosis.
    </p>
  </section>

  <RelatedArcana />
  <RelatedCalculators items={relatedCalculators} />
</BaseLayout>
